11
00:00:37.485 --> 00:00:40.652
(audience applauding)

12
00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:47.517
He's asking me, "I stand?"

13
00:00:47.517 --> 00:00:49.650
"Hi, I'm not sure if you remember me,

14
00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.340
but I remember you when you came

15
00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.850
