22
00:01:08.773 --> 00:01:09.840
Thank you and I love you so much."

23
00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.518
(audience applauding)

24
00:01:13.518 --> 00:01:16.360
"I love the New York School for the Deaf.

25
00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.993
It's called 'Fanwood,' and we love Fanwood."

26
00:01:20.021 --> 00:01:23.380
Thank you so much Manuel for your beautiful words.

27
00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:26.650
And may I ask you guys as a last question,

28
00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:30.670
