30
00:01:34.723 --> 00:01:35.613
Yes.

31
00:01:35.613 --> 00:01:36.555
Yes.

32
00:01:36.555 --> 00:01:38.525
(audience applauding)

33
00:01:38.525 --> 00:01:39.717
"Yes, and 10,000%."

34
00:01:41.374 --> 00:01:42.207
"10,000%."

35
00:01:42.207 --> 00:01:43.697
"And it's historic too."

36
00:01:45.526 --> 00:01:47.700
"While we were shooting the film, I told Troy,

37
00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:50.440
I said, 'This is good stuff.'

38
00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.110
I'm gonna be on my best behavior with my language here.

39
00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:54.300
I could have said something else, but anyway.

40
00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:57.484
No, I knew that this is something

41
00:01:57.484 --> 00:02:00.550
