43
00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:04.200
they would be amazed from it.

44
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.377
And yeah, I knew it."

45
00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:09.600
"And my wife, who's a teacher of ASL,

46
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:12.430
