48
00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:16.830
and weren't doing their homework or weren't studying.

49
00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.830 line:15%
And then they found out that her husband was nominated

50
00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:22.420 line:15%
for an Oscar and all these kids changed their behavior,

51
00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:24.400 line:15%
