53
00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:26.710
(audience applauding)

54
00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:27.547
Yeah.

55
00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.260
"It made my wife's life

56
00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:31.120
so much easier as a teacher, how cool.

57
00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:32.147
Thank you, CODA."

58
00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:35.900
I cannot thank you enough.

59
00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:38.750
I have been waiting and anticipating this conversation

60
00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:41.930
