62
00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:49.563
So thank you for putting this out into the world.

63
00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:55.820
I feel like from the scene also when she's singing

64
00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:59.980
that I need to read people's faces more.

65
00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:04.980
And the way we realize a pivotal moment of someone's life

66
00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:11.700
