68
00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:18.683
And it was a very awakening lesson for me.

69
00:03:19.587 --> 00:03:21.420
"Emilia Jones who played that role

70
00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:22.850
of our daughter is just,

71
00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:24.080
I don't know if there's a right word,

72
00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:28.620
but she's the gem of all gems.

73
00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:31.700 line:15%
And she's such a talented actress,

74
00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.900 line:15%
someone who played so many...

75
00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.760 line:15%
She had so many hats during the making of this film,

76
00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:41.200
