77
00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.530
The four of us together just melded as actors.

78
00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.800
We trusted each other and had a lot of fun.

79
00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:51.140
It was hard work, but at the end, we were very grateful

80
00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.880
