82
00:03:56.443 --> 00:04:00.170
I'm so excited. I celebrate you.

83
00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.710
Marlee, I love you.

84
00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:04.750
Troy, I'm so happy to finally make your acquaintance

85
00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.410
